                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Func^L(PSh(C),D) \subset Func(PSh(C),D)
            for the full
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sub-quasi-category"} sub-quasi-category
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category+of+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-functors"} (∞,1)-category of (∞,1)-functors
            on those that
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/preserved+colimit"} preserve
            small
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/limit+in+a+quasi-category"} colimits
          .un_lemma
            %h6#lemma_2 Lemma
            %p
              Pre-composition with the Yoneda embedding
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi j
